# IETM VI — Chat-inspired interface foundation

**Files**

- `ietm-vi.css`: complete independent CSS baseline for scoped React / HTML applications.
- `preview.html`: local showcase with theme toggle, responsive layout, interactive buttons, form controls, example tables, and non-operational technical content.

## Quick start

Copy `ietm-vi.css` into your app and import it once:

```jsx
import './styles/ietm-vi.css';

export default function App() {
  return (
    <div className="ietm-ui" data-theme="light">
      <div className="ui-app">
        <aside className="ui-sidebar">Navigation</aside>
        <main className="ui-main">
          <header className="ui-topbar">IETM VI</header>
          <article className="ui-content ui-document">
            <h1>Publication title</h1>
            <p>Rendered document content.</p>
          </article>
        </main>
      </div>
    </div>
  );
}
```

Switch `data-theme` between `light`, `dark` or `system`. The design is deliberately scoped to `.ietm-ui`, so it does not reset styles in other React roots or the surrounding portal.

Open `preview.html` locally in a browser to examine the result. No external resource fetches required.

